power: supply: bq256xx: consume PHY-owned U30 Air BC1.2 results

Replace the independent PMIC polling/BQ IINDET fallback with one PHY owner.
Its completion notifier updates the existing event-driven current worker.
Type-C Rp, PD, user charging choices and charger power-role handling remain.

